      "content": "\"a relief\"? i don't know. it doesn't feel like a relief. it feels like everything i was was the only reason to even wake up. without that, there's nothing left to do. i look at people out there living their lives and i just feel... disconnected. like i'm watching a movie i'm not even in. what's even the point of trying to \"show up\" if there's nothing left to show?",
